{"id":"12dd1abd58868c22","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-WKL0-compactness.md","title":"WKL0 and Coded Cantor Compactness","display":"thm-WKL0-compactness — WKL0 and Coded Cantor Compactness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-WKL0-compactness","aliases":["62-thm-WKL0-compactness"],"display":"thm-WKL0-compactness — WKL0 and Coded Cantor Compactness","depends_on":["[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-WKL0]]","[[62-df-Cantor-compactness]]","[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §IV.1 (explicit coded consequences and reversals)","source_pages":[127,128,129,130],"source_pdf_pages":[145,146,147,148]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-WKL0-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-WKL0-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-WKL0-compactness — WKL0 and Coded Cantor Compactness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"87afe420a89e1fce\" href=\"?note=87afe420a89e1fce\" title=\"62-df-WKL0\">62-df-WKL0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3f6d8efae0e395b8\" href=\"?note=3f6d8efae0e395b8\" title=\"62-df-Cantor-compactness\">62-df-Cantor-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §IV.1 (explicit coded consequences and reversals)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>127</span><span>128</span><span>129</span><span>130</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>145</span><span>146</span><span>147</span><span>148</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"87afe420a89e1fce\" href=\"?note=87afe420a89e1fce\" title=\"62-df-WKL0\">62-df-WKL0</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{open}}\">\\(\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{open}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{FIP}}\">\\(\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{FIP}}\\)</span> 的树编码版本见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3f6d8efae0e395b8\" href=\"?note=3f6d8efae0e395b8\" title=\"62-df-Cantor-compactness\">62-df-Cantor-compactness</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\">\\(\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}WKL0\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\{\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{open}}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\{\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{FIP}}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}WKL0\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\{\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{open}}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\{\\mathrm{CC}_{\\mathrm{FIP}}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>开覆盖正向：取尚未进入 U 任一前缀的二叉树。若无有限子覆盖，它每层有结点，WKL 路径违反覆盖。反向对无路径树 T 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=2^{&lt;N}\\setminus T\">\\(U=2^{&lt;N}\\setminus T\\)</span>，有限覆盖给一个统一逃逸高度，故 T 不能无限。</p>\n<p>FIP 正向取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\{s\\in2^{&lt;N}:\\forall i\\le\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\ s\\in(C)_i\\}\">\\(D=\\{s\\in2^{&lt;N}:\\forall i\\le\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\ s\\in(C)_i\\}\\)</span>；FIP 提供每层结点，D 是树，任一路径同时属于全部闭集。反向给无限 T，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i=\\{s:s\\upharpoonright\\min(\\operatorname{lh}(s),i)\\in T\\}\">\\(C_i=\\{s:s\\upharpoonright\\min(\\operatorname{lh}(s),i)\\in T\\}\\)</span>。任意有限初始段用 T 中一个足够长结点加恒定尾巴取得公共路径；全交路径即为 T 的路径。min 为数值最小值。此节点从 IV.1 的编码紧致性给出完整归约，避免跨书全幂集拓扑对象与内部路径量词混用。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），§IV.1 (explicit coded consequences and reversals)；纸面页 127, 128, 129, 130；PDF 页 145, 146, 147, 148。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-WKL0","status":"resolved","id":"87afe420a89e1fce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-WKL0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Cantor-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"3f6d8efae0e395b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Cantor-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"78162